---
title: Blog Archive
layout: 'base.njk'
---

<div class="blog-hero">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="section-badge section-badge--grid">The Archive</span>
    <h1 class="section-title text-gradient" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin-top: 0.5rem;">All Articles &amp; Insights</h1>
    <p class="section-subtitle" style="max-width: 36rem; margin: 0.75rem auto 0;">
      A comprehensive archive of every guide, dev log, and reflection on the road to becoming a better developer.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section container" style="padding-top: 1rem;">
  <div class="articles-grid">
    {%- for post in collections.post | reverse -%}
      <div class="scroll-reveal">
        {% include 'card-grid.njk' %}
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</div>
